  "implementation": [
    "Parse SIMBAD table cells instead of the first matching tooltip word; correct four proper-motion pairs, separate spectral quality, limit identifiers to their actual table and record UTF-8 field locations.",
    "Recompute captured raw SHA/bytes and validate HTTPS/plan/object/path metadata before candidate parsing; reject fixture or forged capture metadata and tampered pack summary/boundaries.",
    "Recompute V621 candidate data against independently located real raw fields while preserving the previous exact candidate pack and immutable V616/V619/V620 files.",
    "Show corrected candidate fields and provenance in the review panel; derive 12/12/12 from actual roster rows and mark route/visual/lifecycle observation not-run.",
    "Replace implicit historical build selection with explicit SHA-pinned evidence input; verify current source bytes and derive gates from actual referenced inputs.",
    "Create a candidate metadata package with identity, evidence index, rollback and gates; offline verifier recomputes the evidence and rejects synchronized forged gate copies.",
    "Report actual false writeback flags in root manifest probe, with boundary validity separate from the underlying values."
  ],
